{"seq":1,"slug":"translation-management-systems","title":"翻译管理系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-internationalization/content-translation/translation-management-systems","wordCount":1503,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"翻译管理系统\">翻译管理系统</h1><p>翻译管理系统（TMS）是后端国际化管道中连接开发与本地化的枢纽。它管理翻译资源的全生命周期——从源字符串提取、翻译者分配、审校流程到交付集成。后端工程师需要理解 TMS 的集成模式，因为翻译管道的效率直接决定了新 locale 上线的速度和翻译质量的可控性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>Translation Memory (TM)</strong>：已翻译片段的复用数据库，100% 匹配自动填充，降低重复翻译成本</li>\n<li><strong>资源格式选择</strong>：JSON flat key-value（简单）、ICU MessageFormat（语法丰富）、XLIFF 2.0（元数据完整）各有适用场景</li>\n<li><strong>CI/CD 集成模式</strong>：推送式（代码变更触发 TMS 同步）、OTA（运行时动态加载翻译）、混合式</li>\n<li><strong>分支策略</strong>：trunk-based + 翻译延迟容忍是与持续部署兼容的推荐方案</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"tms-在-i18n-管道中的位置\">TMS 在 i18n 管道中的位置</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph Development&#10;        A[Source Code] --&gt; B[String Extraction&lt;br/&gt;CLI / CI hook]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph TMS&#10;        B --&gt; C[Translation Memory]&#10;        C --&gt; D[Machine Translation&lt;br/&gt;Pre-fill]&#10;        D --&gt; E[Human Translation]&#10;        E --&gt; F[Review / QA]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Delivery&#10;        F --&gt; G[Export to&lt;br/&gt;resource bundles]&#10;        G --&gt; H[CI/CD Pipeline]&#10;        H --&gt; I[Production Deploy]&#10;    end\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph Development\n        A[Source Code] --&gt; B[String Extraction&lt;br/&gt;CLI / CI hook]\n    end\n    subgraph TMS\n        B --&gt; C[Translation Memory]\n        C --&gt; D[Machine Translation&lt;br/&gt;Pre-fill]\n        D --&gt; E[Human Translation]\n        E --&gt; F[Review / QA]\n    end\n    subgraph Delivery\n        F --&gt; G[Export to&lt;br/&gt;resource bundles]\n        G --&gt; H[CI/CD Pipeline]\n        H --&gt; I[Production Deploy]\n    end</pre><p>TMS 的核心价值不只是一个翻译编辑器——它提供：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Translation Memory (TM)</strong>：已翻译片段的数据库，复用率越高成本越低</li>\n<li><strong>术语库（Termbase）</strong>：确保同一术语在所有上下文中一致翻译</li>\n<li><strong>上下文信息</strong>：截图、注释、字符限制——帮助翻译者理解语境</li>\n<li><strong>工作流自动化</strong>：字符串变更自动触发翻译任务，无需手动协调</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"资源文件格式选择\">资源文件格式选择</h2><p>后端翻译资源存储的格式选择影响 TMS 集成、运行时加载和开发者体验：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>格式</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>劣势</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>JSON (flat key-value)</td>\n<td>简单、广泛支持</td>\n<td>无复数/性别原生支持</td>\n<td>Web 应用、简单 API</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ICU MessageFormat</td>\n<td>复数/选择/嵌套</td>\n<td>语法学习曲线</td>\n<td>语法复杂的消息</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>XLIFF 2.0</td>\n<td>行业标准、元数据丰富</td>\n<td>XML 冗长</td>\n<td>大型企业、专业翻译</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>gettext (.po)</td>\n<td>成熟、工具链完善</td>\n<td>二进制 .mo 编译步骤</td>\n<td>传统后端应用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ARB (Application Resource Bundle)</td>\n<td>JSON 兼容、带元数据</td>\n<td>生态较小</td>\n<td>Flutter/Dart</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>2026 年的趋势：越来越多 TMS 支持 <strong>MessageFormat 2.0</strong> 作为消息格式（spec 于 2025 年 3 月达到 Final Candidate，语法和语义已锁定），但实际采用仍在早期。i18next-mf2 插件周下载量仅约 10 次，主流框架（FormatJS、Lingui）尚未公布 MF2 迁移路线图。</p>\n<h2 id=\"tms-与-ci-cd-集成模式\">TMS 与 CI/CD 集成模式</h2><p>翻译管道与代码管道的集成有三种架构模式：</p>\n<p><strong>模式 1：推送式（Source → TMS）</strong></p>\n<p>开发者提交代码时，CI 自动提取新增/变更的源字符串并推送到 TMS。翻译完成后，TMS 通过 webhook 通知 CI 拉取翻译结果。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# GitHub Actions: 提交时同步源字符串到 TMS&#10;on:&#10;  push:&#10;    paths:&#10;      - &#39;src/locales/en/**&#39;&#10;&#10;jobs:&#10;  sync-translations:&#10;    steps:&#10;      - uses: actions/checkout@v4&#10;      - name: Push sources to TMS&#10;        run: |&#10;          tms-cli push --source src/locales/en \\&#10;                       --project $PROJECT_ID \\&#10;                       --branch $GITHUB_REF_NAME\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># GitHub Actions: 提交时同步源字符串到 TMS</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    paths</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'src/locales/en/**'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">jobs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  sync-translations</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    steps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/checkout@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Push sources to TMS</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          tms-cli push --source src/locales/en \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">                       --project $PROJECT_ID \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">                       --branch $GITHUB_REF_NAME</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>模式 2：拉取式（TMS → Repo）</strong></p>\n<p>翻译者在 TMS 中完成翻译后，CI 定时或由 webhook 触发，从 TMS 拉取最新翻译并提交 PR。</p>\n<p><strong>模式 3：OTA（Over-the-Air）</strong></p>\n<p>翻译资源不打包进部署产物，而是运行时从 TMS CDN 动态加载。适合需要即时更新翻译而无需重新部署的场景。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模式</th>\n<th>部署频率要求</th>\n<th>翻译延迟</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>推送+PR</td>\n<td>每次部署包含最新翻译</td>\n<td>取决于部署频率</td>\n<td>严格质量控制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>OTA</td>\n<td>实时</td>\n<td>秒级</td>\n<td>频繁翻译更新、A/B 测试</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>混合</td>\n<td>核心打包 + 次要 OTA</td>\n<td>核心低延迟、次要实时</td>\n<td>大规模应用</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"源字符串管理\">源字符串管理</h2><p>源字符串的组织方式直接影响翻译效率和代码可维护性：</p>\n<p><strong>Key 命名规范</strong>——结构化的 key 比自然语言 key 更易管理：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"// 好：结构化 key，层级清晰&#10;{&#10;  &quot;order.status.pending&quot;: &quot;Your order is being processed&quot;,&#10;  &quot;order.status.shipped&quot;: &quot;Your order has been shipped&quot;,&#10;  &quot;order.error.payment_failed&quot;: &quot;Payment could not be processed&quot;&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 差：自然语言 key，改源文案就断链&#10;{&#10;  &quot;Your order is being processed&quot;: &quot;...&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 好：结构化 key，层级清晰</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"order.status.pending\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Your order is being processed\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"order.status.shipped\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Your order has been shipped\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"order.error.payment_failed\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Payment could not be processed\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 差：自然语言 key，改源文案就断链</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"Your order is being processed\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"...\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>上下文注释</strong>——帮助翻译者理解使用场景：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;cart.item_count&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;message&quot;: &quot;{count, plural, one {# item} other {# items}}&quot;,&#10;    &quot;description&quot;: &quot;Shopping cart badge showing number of items. Max 3 digits.&quot;,&#10;    &quot;max_length&quot;: 12,&#10;    &quot;screenshot&quot;: &quot;https://assets.example.com/screenshots/cart-badge.png&quot;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"cart.item_count\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"message\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"{count, plural, one {# item} other {# items}}\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"description\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Shopping cart badge showing number of items. Max 3 digits.\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"max_length\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">12</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"screenshot\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"https://assets.example.com/screenshots/cart-badge.png\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>max_length</code> 约束对后端格式化尤为重要——德语翻译平均比英语长 30%，日语可能更短。如果 UI 有固定宽度，后端需要在翻译资源中标注最大长度以供翻译者遵守。</p>\n<h2 id=\"translation-memory-的后端利用\">Translation Memory 的后端利用</h2><p>TM 的核心数据结构是**翻译单元（Translation Unit）**对齐的源语言-目标语言对：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>TM</mtext><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mtext>metadata</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∣</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>source</mtext></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>target</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{TM} = \\{(s_i, t_i, \\text{metadata}_i) \\mid s_i \\in L_{\\text{source}}, t_i \\in L_{\\text{target}}\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">TM</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">metadata</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6891em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">source</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">target</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>TM 匹配类型：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>匹配类型</th>\n<th>相似度</th>\n<th>行为</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>100% (Exact)</td>\n<td>完全相同</td>\n<td>自动填充，不计费</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Context Match</td>\n<td>100% + 相同上下文</td>\n<td>高置信度自动填充</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Fuzzy (75-99%)</td>\n<td>部分相似</td>\n<td>需人工审核修改</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MT Pre-fill</td>\n<td>机器翻译</td>\n<td>必须人工审校</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>No Match</td>\n<td>&lt;75%</td>\n<td>从头翻译</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>后端集成 TM 的典型模式：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant CI as CI Pipeline&#10;    participant TMS as Translation Management&#10;    participant TM as Translation Memory&#10;    participant MT as Machine Translation&#10;&#10;    CI-&gt;&gt;TMS: Push new/changed strings&#10;    TMS-&gt;&gt;TM: Query matches&#10;    TM--&gt;&gt;TMS: Exact/Fuzzy matches&#10;    TMS-&gt;&gt;MT: Pre-translate unmatched&#10;    MT--&gt;&gt;TMS: MT suggestions&#10;    TMS-&gt;&gt;TMS: Assign to translators&#10;    Note over TMS: Human review &amp; translate&#10;    TMS-&gt;&gt;TM: Store approved translations&#10;    TMS--&gt;&gt;CI: Webhook: translations ready\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant CI as CI Pipeline\n    participant TMS as Translation Management\n    participant TM as Translation Memory\n    participant MT as Machine Translation\n\n    CI-&gt;&gt;TMS: Push new/changed strings\n    TMS-&gt;&gt;TM: Query matches\n    TM--&gt;&gt;TMS: Exact/Fuzzy matches\n    TMS-&gt;&gt;MT: Pre-translate unmatched\n    MT--&gt;&gt;TMS: MT suggestions\n    TMS-&gt;&gt;TMS: Assign to translators\n    Note over TMS: Human review &amp; translate\n    TMS-&gt;&gt;TM: Store approved translations\n    TMS--&gt;&gt;CI: Webhook: translations ready</pre><h2 id=\"翻译分支策略\">翻译分支策略</h2><p>大型项目的翻译与代码分支如何对齐是一个工程挑战：</p>\n<p><strong>问题</strong>：feature branch A 新增了 20 个字符串，feature branch B 修改了 5 个字符串。两个分支各自推送到 TMS 后，翻译者面临两组可能冲突的任务。合并到 main 时，翻译也需要合并。</p>\n<p><strong>解决方案</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>TMS 分支映射</strong>：TMS 支持分支概念（Crowdin、Phrase 都有），每个代码分支对应一个 TMS 分支。合并时 TMS 自动处理翻译合并</li>\n<li><strong>Trunk-based + 翻译延迟容忍</strong>：所有字符串变更先进 main，TMS 只跟踪 main 分支。新字符串在翻译完成前显示 fallback（英语原文）</li>\n<li><strong>翻译冻结窗口</strong>：大版本发布前设定翻译截止日期（translation freeze），此后不允许新增源字符串</li>\n</ol>\n<p>推荐方案 2（trunk-based）——它与持续部署模型兼容，减少了翻译合并冲突，代价是短暂的 fallback 显示。对于动态内容的本地化策略（用户生成内容、变量插值），参见<a href=\"dynamic-content-localization\">动态内容本地化</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>TMS 是翻译管道的编排中心，Translation Memory 提供复用率和一致性保障。后端与 TMS 的集成模式选择（推送/OTA/混合）取决于部署频率和翻译延迟容忍度。结构化的 key 命名、上下文注释和长度约束让翻译者能高质量完成工作。trunk-based 分支策略与持续部署兼容，避免了翻译合并冲突。MessageFormat 2.0 的 spec 已稳定，但生态采用仍在早期——当前生产系统可继续使用 MF1，同时关注 MF2 迁移路径。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"翻译管理系统","id":"翻译管理系统"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"TMS 在 i18n 管道中的位置","id":"tms-在-i18n-管道中的位置"},{"level":2,"text":"资源文件格式选择","id":"资源文件格式选择"},{"level":2,"text":"TMS 与 CI/CD 集成模式","id":"tms-与-ci-cd-集成模式"},{"level":2,"text":"源字符串管理","id":"源字符串管理"},{"level":2,"text":"Translation Memory 的后端利用","id":"translation-memory-的后端利用"},{"level":2,"text":"翻译分支策略","id":"翻译分支策略"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"排序规则与搜索","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-internationalization/data-handling/collation-sorting-search"},"next":{"title":"动态内容本地化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-internationalization/content-translation/dynamic-content-localization"}}